{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10003_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:691d1dc0fe4d2c42ec6e91e24121a70c6d5bdd32dc47969ecd2151e578a9f389",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3fd48d8a14e28115ce2d60b136574bf462a5fe036d0e8ddd0937ac808e8eeff",
      "text": "制作人！我听阿斯兰和神谷说了～！\n听说那个饰品，要正式发售了对不对？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a2e42bd755f13f92ec7aca87cb6e372316b0a9b1230da949929c0892d322372",
      "text": "是的。以大家为灵感创作的那个\n同人作品，已经决定商品化了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75e7d2c510f85a5789d4c71d55c9a1c6f053e3a12023d37920ddcbe6903c0d6d",
      "text": "将作为12月的圣诞礼物进行发售。而且\n令人惊讶的是，对方还邀请大家出演CM！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:595ac1c4cb0d580b2501ecbb7f4f418d691b536a3dbe0be2a3877d28806b9e94",
      "text": "据说是看到阿斯兰先生点的“赞！”之后\n联系我们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08ccea7409520c2e83dec57883aa4a154d6a79c253183b79fd7278e2fbd68230",
      "text": "不仅为我们制作了珠宝饰品，\n甚至连CM都交给我们出演……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd20b8d6741ae8b97eb054966f92f602f61ea650d57237d6c20d076089840586",
      "text": "这都多亏了阿斯兰先生点的那记“赞！”呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d10616922c1a2055d27202ecd854474786ff0faed5f9c54d7f90148e3bf1ca5f",
      "text": "嗯！谢谢你，阿斯兰。\n人家超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f4f16349ab50996c4ec5e0942dc3f824cfa649994fb1fa35f292d1756054a77",
      "text": "无、无须多礼。吾从一开始\n便预见到了此番未来。啊——哈哈哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3108bc9cbe60da0b1d03435ea171f7fbf11ed0c3d888c4b76f725b14b5c8c337",
      "text": "Gift除了礼物的含义之外，也有才能\n和特别的力量的意思在里面哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb41d1d0ba9b2a624a0fd2a5be8d4600327de488ee116e5580fbfaf01bf09821",
      "text": "啊啊。如果作为Cafe Parade的我们拥有\n特别的力量的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6d1c35e27cd408e3e3ddcc652d48bd2b7607eda43c2dfcf0b3224f156a6e49a",
      "text": "那么我希望通过这些珠宝饰品，\n将那股力量传递给全世界的大家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8168d5b3e8157eb8f85cbc7fdb99d5ff6798cc6577eec4bd9b7d4099cb425e8",
      "text": "希望能无论何时都陪伴在身旁，照亮并点亮\n大家的人生呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee306a56635ccf5b7d73e5afc922a17eb415863f111c93a6bc3374cefb6689ae",
      "text": "好的！大家一起传递给所有人吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000170:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000177:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdcc0b26cbb5f105d5df1e6aa4c39fa70022707efeb80a8c866bfe0ea03e71cb",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n珠宝的样品\n收到了哦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_35</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000179:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71c23f5fd35b0b44e51ff6efb06e498d1086d8767c11e318b73f42be1298bf7c",
      "text": "谢谢你\n帮我们拜托对方～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000181:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa8edfa0cf9415cb799faf03dadf4285e2a700cb172d1647ec1f86bcbbfbbe5f",
      "text": "照片虽然也很棒，\n但实物还要更——加\n超级可爱呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000183:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27c2c096541598ac9a151dff3d98f72649a68240312be98977b5a3714fe50d0e",
      "text": "明明这么小巧，\n做工却如此精巧啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000185:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29377eb48526c09f279deda6489a1e30ed336cedb898287731a9f401c01e5816",
      "text": "原来如此，真是受益匪浅。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000187:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fd77a037571e5b0116d33c36507535f5e4aa20e6a8302be74398254164b9554",
      "text": "一想到这是对方心中想着我们\n制作出来的东西，\n喜悦就更深了一层呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000189:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d972dc588c9ff6eabc3d3214c6c3df1c370e616ceaaf4e08f516b7b865f88618",
      "text": "对方也很高兴",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000189:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a05cc56b00a7d919f3a009f1d6797e1c0d8745e3412390973d5f0e3115581fc",
      "text": "各位能答应下来，\n对方也非常高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000190:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be534aa8b3c1788bf2447b43e03ed2cda01f2929b4aa9dc628cd13b1ce7f8cef",
      "text": "每一件都很棒呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000190:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fe58688765367cb6a54c368ef2a70673928fcecd64d582e779decdafe265beb",
      "text": "每一件都很棒呢！\n听说对方也很期待成品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000194:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28c7a4488ad168b01d55878b5df85397a1c8d62c066e655185cca124cf23bf5d",
      "text": "能得到这样的评价，真是深感光荣呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000196:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12351ce197e1a30e344654f6e0b0f7c66616e3b2a77312026c68d6cb81e9f7f2",
      "text": "说起来撒旦也\n收到了饰品\n对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000198:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4386286ab66feab3d869e5758e39660be8c2642fdea0c52e59f83682e574bbc6",
      "text": "好想知道是什么感觉啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10003_01:1_3_10003_01_e:cmd-000200:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6538f687d5d2e9f325576143b5ab4e8eedf85fe1f505dbeb11aece502f40e27b",
      "text": "吾已知晓。\n稍后便将残影传送与汝。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
